------------

- Ship LICENSE, COPYING.LESSER and this NOTICE with the application.
- Keep per-file headers.
- Offer source for LGPLv3 Horos when you distribute binaries.
- The DICOMweb client, plugins, report authoring and HorosCloud are preserved.
- Incompatibilities or doubts must be resolved before distributing the
  affected component. This file does not authorise a combination.

